    <div class="faq-list" style="text-align:left;margin-top:48px;">

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          Do I need to provide content, or do you write it?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">We do both. If you have content (text about your services, team bio, etc.), great — we'll use it. If you don't, we write it for you based on our discovery call. We're good at capturing the voice of a small business. Just give us the facts about what you do and who you serve, and we'll write compelling copy that sells your business.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          What if I don't have a logo or photos?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">No problem. We can design a simple, professional logo for you as part of the process — or point you toward affordable local options. For photos, we can use high-quality stock photography that matches your industry until you're ready to do a real shoot. Many clients start with stock photos and replace them over time as part of their unlimited updates.</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-btn" aria-expanded="false">
          What if I want changes after the site goes live?
          <span class="faq-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-inner">Unlimited content updates are included in your monthly fee — always. Just email or text us what you need changed, and we'll take care of it, usually within one business day. There are no extra charges for normal content updates. The only add-ons are structural additions like new pages beyond your included 10 ($150/page, one-time) or a blog ($200 one-time).</div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
